/491830007_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EYm5l6o622oQ7kNvwHdfJaX&_nc_oc=AdqL8-khPfdxjUOrxwJGo8OmTetl_AZJQgX0cMWXjOEhqY350b0HwXKo71dfhLSyq18&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQISyX9u4sdutAqaH2c7TOkDp57cHaBF4zw8nywrKl_hkA&oe=6AAE99C2"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=prEV7rUBP5AQ7kNvwFwDXu0&_nc_oc=AdqwwtRiMtSDwItbbnHHnKzlXasHUZY7H1n9xrcru11bJHPdgWBuzy0SJbNcfe-Qksc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIDA4Cekxbrqlgm4q1AR1hKKvEKY8w9Ku8IF2hl_A_Ckg&oe=6AAE8F3F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1bOpA2yCdqsQ7kNvwFkfSoD&_nc_oc=Adr_CJvP7JxBZHUWwhIomvn_HB8teECcm93Rf63HFBO4AMEea_NbZSEhS6b662DzjQA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJCDCuop6x9MnzkaRLrS53kIXkiR3M-SdxQyYKWcRus5Q&oe=6AAE9E30"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strateg